<Layout title="Privacy policy – Ivan Schmid" lang="en" page="privacy" noindex>
	<main class="wrap legal">
		<a class="back" href="/en/">← Back to home</a>
		<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
		<p class="stand">As of October 2026</p>

		<h2>1. Controller</h2>
		<p>
			The person responsible for processing personal data in connection with this website is Ivan Schmid,
			Schmid Business Solutions, Hardeggweg 2, CH-3612 Steffisburg, <a href="mailto:office@schmidbusiness.ch">office@schmidbusiness.ch</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>2. Principle</h2>
		<p>
			The Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (FADP) applies. Where visitors access the website from the EU, the
			General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is also taken into account to the extent applicable.
		</p>

		<h2>3. Contact form</h2>
		<p>
			If you use the contact form, your name, email address and message are processed in order to respond to your
			enquiry. The message is sent technically via the EmailJS service acting as a processor. Data may also be
			processed outside Switzerland and the EU (including the USA). Your details are not used for any other purpose
			and are not passed on to third parties.
		</p>

		<h2>4. External services</h2>
		<p>
			To send the contact form, a software library is loaded from jsDelivr (content delivery network) when the home
			page is opened; your IP address may be transmitted in the process. Fonts are loaded locally from this website;
			no Google services are used.
		</p>

		<h2>5. Hosting and server logs</h2>
		<p>
			When the website is accessed, technical access data (including IP address, date and time, page requested,
			browser used) is automatically recorded in server logs by the hosting provider. This data is used for system
			security and error analysis.
		</p>

		<h2>6. Cookies</h2>
		<p>This website does not set any cookies and does not store any data in your browser.</p>

		<h2>7. Your rights</h2>
		<p>
			Within the scope of applicable data protection law, you have the right to information, rectification and
			erasure of your personal data and the right to object to processing. Contact: <a href="mailto:office@schmidbusiness.ch">office@schmidbusiness.ch</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>8. Changes</h2>
		<p>This privacy policy may be amended at any time. The version published on this page applies.</p>
	</main>
</Layout>
